Package: nyczips
Title: Superseded: New York City ZIP Code Geometry (Use 'nycmaps')
Version: 0.0.1.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Kieran", "Healy", , "kjhealy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9114-981X"))
Description: Superseded by the 'nycmaps' package. This package used to
    provide New York City ZIP code tabulation area polygons and a table of
    ZIP codes by borough; both are now in 'nycmaps', with the same
    contents, and have been removed from here.
